# Capacitor generates the native projects with `cap add ios/android`. They are
# large and reproducible from capacitor.config.ts + the deep-link/push notes in
# README.md, so they are not committed by default. If you customize native code
# (Info.plist, AndroidManifest, entitlements) beyond what the README documents,
# remove the relevant ignore line and commit that project.
/ios
/android

node_modules
package-lock.json
